sequenceDiagram
    actor R as Renter
    actor O as Owner
    participant FE as React Client
    participant API as Express API
    participant DB as MongoDB
    participant SCHED as Scheduler (node-cron)
    participant REDIS as Redis Pub/Sub
    participant NOTIF as Notification Dispatcher

    R->>FE: Request rental (item, due date)
    FE->>API: POST /rentals {listingId, dueDate}
    API->>DB: create Rental (status=requested)
    O->>FE: Approve rental request
    FE->>API: PATCH /rentals/:id/approve
    API->>DB: update status=approved
    API->>API: generate unique QR code (qrcode npm)
    API-->>FE: QR code payload

    Note over R,O: At physical handover
    O->>FE: Show QR code
    R->>FE: Scan QR code
    FE->>API: POST /rentals/:id/verify-handover {qrCode}
    API->>DB: validate QR uniqueness + rental id
    alt valid & unused
        API->>DB: update status=active, startDate=now
        API-->>FE: 200 OK - handover confirmed
    else invalid/used
        API-->>FE: 400 Error - invalid/used QR code
    end

    SCHED->>DB: scan for rentals nearing dueDate
    SCHED->>REDIS: publish rental.reminder {rentalId}
    REDIS->>NOTIF: consume rental.reminder
    NOTIF->>R: reminder notification (in-app/email)

    R->>FE: Return item / confirm return
    FE->>API: PATCH /rentals/:id/complete
    API->>DB: update status=completed
    API->>DB: stop further reminders for this rental
